# Counter actor

`actor.ts` defines a durable counter, increment and decrement methods, and a notification act for positive even counts. `notifyLayer` supplies the act implementation. No model provider or API key is required.

Run locally with `bun run dev`. In another terminal:

```sh
tdg thread create --name main
tdg call increment null --thread main
tdg call increment null --thread main
tdg call decrement null --thread main
tdg events main
```

Keep state transitions in durable atoms and declare external work through acts. Supply I/O implementations through the host's services.

`worker.ts` hosts the same actor on Cloudflare or Celld. Deploy with `bun run deploy:cloudflare` or `bun run deploy:celld --bucket s3://YOUR-BUCKET`.
